---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<Layout
  title="About | Ferris Decking Co."
  description="Ferris Decking Co. is a Lancaster County, PA deck builder focused on sound structure first and a finish you'll still like in ten years."
>
  <section class="wrap hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>We'd rather tell you no than build it wrong.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Ferris Decking builds for homeowners across Lancaster County — Lititz, Manheim,
      Willow Street, and the city itself. The work is decks, restorations, and the
      outdoor structures that go with them, and it's done by people who'll still be
      answering your calls five years after the last board goes down.
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="plank-rule"></div>

  <section class="wrap values">
    <div class="value">
      <span class="num">01</span>
      <h2>Structure before style</h2>
      <p>Framing, footings, and ledger attachment get checked first on every job — restoration or new build. What's underneath decides what's possible on top.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="value">
      <span class="num">02</span>
      <h2>Permitted, not guessed at</h2>
      <p>Decks over a certain height or attached to the house need a township permit in most of Lancaster County. We pull it before footings go in, not after an inspector asks.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="value">
      <span class="num">03</span>
      <h2>A straight answer on cost</h2>
      <p>An estimate accounts for the lot you actually have — grade, access, existing structure — not a generic per-square-foot number that changes once we're on site.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap cta">
    <h2>Want to talk through your yard?</h2>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href={`${base}/contact/`}>Get a free estimate</a>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-block: 4rem 2.5rem;
    max-width: 56ch;
  }
  .hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.8vw, 2.9rem);
    margin: 0.3em 0 0.5em;
  }
  .lede {
    color: var(--walnut-700);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
  .values {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
    padding-block: 3.5rem;
  }
  .num {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    color: var(--gold-400);
    -webkit-text-stroke: 1px var(--rust-600);
    font-size: 1.7rem;
  }
  .value h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0.5em 0 0.4em;
  }
  .value p {
    color: var(--walnut-700);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .cta {
    text-align: center;
    padding-block: 4.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .values {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
